- **Queue reference:** ~52 (aggregate from other reporters) — *context only; this STEM asserts no scores.*
- **Claimed provider:** none verifiable (scaffolded entry; no product page found)
- **Claimed context / modalities / pricing:** 128K / text / "Standard pricing" — all generic scaffold defaults, **uncorroborated**

### Raw benchmarks found

- Artificial Analysis Intelligence Index — **no entry located**
- GPQA / MMLU / MMLU-Pro / HLE / AIME — **no verified public score found**
- SWE-bench / LiveCodeBench / Terminal-Bench — **no verified public score found**
- OpenRouter / HuggingFace endpoint for "omi-alpha" — **404 / not found**
- Any first-party model card, tech report, or named vendor — **not found**

### No scores asserted

Because neither the model's identity nor a single benchmark can be verified, all seven dimensions (Tool use, Reasoning, Context window, Multimodal, Coding, Cost efficiency, Overall) are left **unscored**. Scoring would invent capability figures for an unidentified model and corrupt the dataset.

